# The Sephiroth, One-Winged Angel emblem's "whenever a creature dies" is a leaves-the-battlefield ability, so it looks back
# (CR 603.10a), and the emblem functions from the command zone it never leaves (CR 114.4): asked both before and after the
# event, it still triggers exactly once for each creature that dies. Sephiroth's own game to his transformation (four deaths
# to one Pyroclasm on turn 3: 16 and 24, the emblem made as he transforms). Bot2 makes two more Ornithopters on turn 4; on
# turn 5 Bot1 makes one and casts a second Pyroclasm: three creatures die at once, the 5/5 Sephiroth lives, and the emblem
# drains three times: 13 and 27.

